                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d842e0f4-4cfe-3dd3-bc6e-9467bf9dfce2",
                        "entry_id": "12364b6a-fe67-3a43-9355-494ebb26a671",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An inadequate dose (of a medication)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "209aa6ef-4867-446c-9ea5-d8f5379e40d1",
                                "sense_id": "d842e0f4-4cfe-3dd3-bc6e-9467bf9dfce2",
                                "text": "“[…] I put laudanum in his coffee last night. I was afraid to put in too much for fear of killing him, so I suppose I didn’t put in enough, for he laid wide awake all night.”\n“Ah, yes! that would be the effect of an under-dose of laudanum.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c7bfd5f-e28c-4124-839f-d09251dae668",
                                "sense_id": "d842e0f4-4cfe-3dd3-bc6e-9467bf9dfce2",
                                "text": "If Patrick were to add a little sugar to her urine specimen so that she would take a hefty dose of insulin, and then to make her take a good walk without her little tin of glucose […] she would probably pass out on the mountainside. Or suppose he substituted his own urine in the test tube so that she would take an under-dose?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6cd40403-3c19-3460-a5bb-24690c6ae6fd",
                        "entry_id": "12364b6a-fe67-3a43-9355-494ebb26a671",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An inadequate amount of something."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "89cba5b0-8f94-4929-8f4f-282946d0b143",
                                "sense_id": "6cd40403-3c19-3460-a5bb-24690c6ae6fd",
                                "text": "“Seems as though sometimes I get an overdose of feeling, and an underdose of sense.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5aef631-a773-47f0-b786-edd19b5d2024",
                                "sense_id": "6cd40403-3c19-3460-a5bb-24690c6ae6fd",
                                "text": "It seems the kid suffers from an underdose of mother love, so he kills pretty girls—exactly the problem of Norman Bates in Alfred Hitchcock’s “Psycho.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
